# Component Conventions

- Style with aithoria design tokens (`var(--*)` CSS variables) and Tailwind utilities
- Server components by default; "use client" only for state/effects/browser APIs
- Props interface: `{ComponentName}Props`
- Use `cn()` utility from src/lib/utils.ts for className merging
- Ensure accessibility: proper ARIA attributes, keyboard navigation
- Named exports only, no default exports
- Colocate component-specific types in the same file
